        "created_at": "2016-02-01T19:44:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Throwing this out there. Someone on the Steam forum said that finishing neither the Operative OR the Chairman with melee was needed. A lot though are saying that they did NOT unlock when Combat Stance wasn't in play. The general concensus is that Wraith needs to finish off both. Gonna give it a try.</p><p>EDIT: Didn't work. People are saying everyone needs to be 10 hp or less. Will try that later.</p>",
