        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e9a140/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-01T20:43:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Lost to IL a few fights ago, fought Chairman in Silver Gulch. Team: Team Leader Tachyon, Visionary, Temest, Wraith, Omnitron-X. Killed Chairman with Inventory Barrage (not all equipment out) and killed Operative with melee damage (Throwing Knives switched to melee and increased by 1 with Twist the Ether). Tempest incapacitated, all others below 10 HP though. Combat Stance was out. No unlock.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lost to IL a few fights ago, fought Chairman in Silver Gulch. Team: Omnitron-X, Scientific Tachyon, Visionary, Wraith. Killed Chairman with Combat Stance (changed damage type to projecticel and increased by 1 with Twist the Ether) then killed Operative with Inventory Barrage (Utility Belt, Razor Barrage, Micro Targeting Computer, Throwing Knives, 3 Mega Computers, Stun Bolt, 2 Infrared Eyepieces destroyed). Combat Stance was out and all heroes were below 10 HP. No unlock.</p>",
