        "created_at": "2016-02-01T21:04:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah I used Barrage to finish Chairman off second. No unlock. I am…stumped beyond all belief.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>\n<p>EDIT: Did it again with everyone at below 10 HP… Nothing. &gt;_&gt;</p>",
