        "created_at": "2016-02-02T01:54:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One of the Steam screenshots had Wraith being unlocked after killing the Chairman (Operative was already flipped) but they did not use Inventory Barrage for the final blow. Not sure how they took out Operative, but did ask. Combat Stance was out.</p><p>Edit: While Wraith was under 10 HP, the rest of the team was not. No one was incapped.</p>",
