        "created_at": "2016-02-02T04:01:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This one seems particularly telling&nbsp;http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=614104917 because it shows that HP doesn't seem to be a factor. &nbsp;The person that got it thought it might have to do with triggering Combat Stance a bunch because they did a lot of Smoke Bombs -&gt; Wraith + Combat Stance shennanigans.</p>",
