        "created_at": "2016-02-02T04:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I will have to see how many Combat Stances I can get to proc tomorrow. I know the last game I had there was at least 5 total including the one which killed the Chairman. 2 of them for sure were against the Operative.</p><p>Edit: Off of Steam forums: Wraith in first position might be a factor and HP of Wraith does not matter.</p>",
