        "created_at": "2016-02-02T08:26:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>Thanks to the investigative work here and on the <a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/app/337150/discussions/0/451852225134864391\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Steam forums</a>, the unlock conditions for Freedom Six Wraith have been determined by the community. Well done everyone!</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Lose a game to Iron Legacy with regular The Wraith on the team. Then, defeat The Chairman with The Wraith as the first hero and without a Legacy on the team. The Wraith must deal the final blows to The Chairman and The Operative.</strong></div>",
