        "username": "grysqrl",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-02T23:01:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks to the investigative work here and on the <a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/app/337150/discussions/0/451852225134864391\" rel=\"nofollow\">Steam forums</a>, the unlock conditions for Freedom Six Wraith have been determined by the community. Well done everyone!&nbsp;<strong>Lose a game to Iron Legacy with regular The Wraith on the team. Then, defeat The Chairman with The Wraith as the first hero and without a Legacy on the team. The Wraith must deal the final blows to The Chairman and The Operative.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Hey, so I just earned it when the Wraith killed the Chairman, but the Operative is still active. Bug? The Wraith -did- take out the Operative seconds later. Maybe because Visionary was on the team, Steam somehow knew what was going to happen?</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=614655119\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dae126afd1172f5078218c39e90afe8637db2286.png\" class=\"site-icon\" data-dominant-color=\"556F8E\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=614655119\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">steamcommunity.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:512/288;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0e4c8f20a64d76701b91379895876b586c695d97.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" data-dominant-color=\"211B19\" width=\"512\" height=\"288\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=614655119\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Steam Community :: Screenshot :: Price of Freedom Wraith earned buggily?</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Steam Community: Sentinels of the Multiverse. Price of Freedom Wraith earned buggily?</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
